WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.359
KATE BISHOP
There's only about a thousand of them,

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.585
and two of us.
And that's not the only thing.

00:00:06.541 --> 00:00:07.867
CLINT BARTON
Even a Black Widow.

00:00:07.918 --> 00:00:08.984
YELENA BELOVA
That was really fun.

00:00:13.166 --> 00:00:14.916
CLINT BARTON
He's someone you don't want to mess with.

00:00:15.208 --> 00:00:16.240
Kingpin.

00:00:16.291 --> 00:00:18.563
WILSON FISK
The people need to be reminded

00:00:18.563 --> 00:00:20.496
that this city belongs to me.

00:00:20.916 --> 00:00:22.281
KATE BISHOP
Wow, I did not see that coming.

